Hello,

It's been a while since I've been seen on RGRN but here's a patch that
implements the request stated in Debian bug #153736 [1].

Basically, if u.ustuck and u.uswallow, and your prayer timeout for being
in deep shit has elapsed, you will get ejected from whatever's swallowed
you or engulfed you.

There is contention over whether this should affect the more common
life-threatening situation of being held by an eel or, earlier on in the
game, maybe an owlbear, *as well* as the engulfment situation. Please
discuss.

-- 
Joshua Kwan

[1] http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=153736

